\section{Why these coordinates}{
In them the log-density is
\eqn{-a|z| - cz^{2}/2 - \log 2 - L(x) + \tfrac{1}{2}\log c} with
\eqn{z = y - \mu}, \eqn{x = ac^{-1/2}} and \eqn{L = \log M}, so the data
